    "created_at": "2025-08-14T18:06:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-14T18:06:32Z",
    "body": "Note: In BCD, [\"deprecated\"](https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/blob/main/docs/data-guidelines/index.md#setting-deprecated) applies when any of the following are true:\n\n> - _Obsolete_, _legacy_, _deprecated_, _end-of-life_, or similar terminology in a specification\n> - Removal of a feature from a specification\n> - Specification text that cautions developers against new use of the feature\n> - Formal discouragement statements from a relevant standards body (for example, meeting minutes that show a committee achieving consensus for removal from a specification, even if the removal has not yet taken place)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
