    "updated_at": "2025-08-19T07:05:25Z",
    "body": "The web platform (or at least the HTML Standard) doesn't have any notion of obsolete/legacy/deprecated/end-of-life, so you'll have to make that determination yourself.\n\nThe other three categories you list are not met for these properties.",
